WEBVTT

01:49.620 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.039 --> 01:57.930
[Episode 10]

02:00.150 --> 02:01.640
Who are you calling stingy?

02:01.640 --> 02:02.920
Who are you saying has small eyes?

02:02.920 --> 02:03.760
Your Highness,

02:03.760 --> 02:05.040
I didn't mean you. Your eyes aren't small.

02:05.040 --> 02:05.920
Let's go, Your Highness.

02:05.920 --> 02:06.950
We'll be late if we don't light
the lanterns now.

02:06.950 --> 02:07.590
Hurry!

02:07.590 --> 02:09.190
Let's go light the lanterns!

02:09.630 --> 02:10.840
Here, come here.

02:11.630 --> 02:13.360
Your eyes are small. Take this.

02:14.150 --> 02:15.360
Thank you, Sir.

02:18.520 --> 02:19.680
So pretty..

02:29.980 --> 02:30.630
Gentlemen.

02:30.630 --> 02:32.470
-Eighteenth Prince
-Long time no see.

02:32.470 --> 02:34.329
I'd like to offer you both a toast.

02:38.000 --> 02:38.800
Gentlemen...

02:38.800 --> 02:39.840
This one here,

02:40.470 --> 02:42.400
hasn't even taken that position yet,

02:42.400 --> 02:44.400
but already acts like this.

02:44.470 --> 02:46.280
Are you satisfied with today's banquet?

02:46.280 --> 02:47.480
Yes, very satisfied.

02:53.910 --> 02:55.430
Mr. Wang.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.720
Mr. Song.

02:57.930 --> 02:59.560
I've been waiting for you all evening.

02:59.560 --> 03:01.970
I finally get to offer you a toast.

03:03.590 --> 03:05.280
The other day in court,

03:05.280 --> 03:06.840
you spoke up for my cousin.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.560
I have etched it into my heart.

03:09.030 --> 03:11.000
There'll be more matters of state in the
future.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.860
I shall seek your advice again.

03:13.060 --> 03:14.860
You're too kind, Your Highness.

03:15.260 --> 03:17.510
Everything I've said in court

03:17.540 --> 03:19.340
was all out of a sense of justice.

03:19.840 --> 03:23.040
I don't deserve such praise from you,
Eighteenth Prince.

03:23.310 --> 03:24.870
Well, I...

03:25.960 --> 03:26.910
Mr. Song,

03:27.190 --> 03:29.079
you're standing on ceremony now.

03:30.240 --> 03:31.030
My cousin

03:31.030 --> 03:33.880
will soon marry your eldest daughter.

03:33.900 --> 03:34.680
Right?

03:34.680 --> 03:35.360
As for me,

03:35.360 --> 03:37.430
Miss Yiting and I will also be...

03:39.240 --> 03:40.000
Mr. Song?

03:40.000 --> 03:40.660
You...

03:40.810 --> 03:41.840
You...

03:41.890 --> 03:43.650
I'm having a stomach ache.

03:43.820 --> 03:44.820
Please excuse me.

03:46.100 --> 03:47.070
Mr. Song.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.240
Mr. Song!

03:48.370 --> 03:48.860
You...

03:51.570 --> 03:53.329
Is this for real?

03:54.280 --> 03:56.079
Did he just decline

03:56.079 --> 03:57.120
the divine wine I offered?

03:57.120 --> 03:59.120
He's really disregarding my pride.

03:59.120 --> 03:59.980
Your Highness,

04:00.030 --> 04:00.840
should we go after him?

04:00.840 --> 04:01.590
Why bother chasing?

04:01.590 --> 04:02.800
What does he have to chase after?

04:02.800 --> 04:04.380
He- He's even acting up now.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.190
Yiting,

04:07.430 --> 04:08.240
there.

04:08.680 --> 04:10.590
The second son of the Vice Minister of
Rites.

04:10.590 --> 04:11.800
Looks sneaky.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.040
What about that one?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.630
The head of the Hanlin Academy.

04:14.630 --> 04:16.120
He was the third-ranked scholar at
just twenty,

04:16.120 --> 04:17.170
he's definitely talented.

04:17.170 --> 04:18.230
Hopelessly rigid.

04:20.440 --> 04:21.640
Then what do you think

04:21.779 --> 04:23.070
about this one here?

04:29.840 --> 04:30.700
Your Highness,

04:31.380 --> 04:32.659
I have some matters to attend to.

04:32.659 --> 04:33.720
I'll take my leave now.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.510
Yiting!

04:35.240 --> 04:35.950
Yiting.

04:36.270 --> 04:37.070
Yiting.

04:37.170 --> 04:38.310
There will be fireworks soon.

04:38.310 --> 04:39.510
Won't you watch them with me?

04:39.510 --> 04:41.390
This is a good opportunity to get to know
me better.

04:41.390 --> 04:42.190
Yiting!

04:43.240 --> 04:44.040
This...

04:44.650 --> 04:47.260
Could it be my appearance is too grand
today,

04:47.920 --> 04:49.650
that it made her feel inferior?

04:52.640 --> 04:53.840
Remember what I said.

04:53.950 --> 04:56.430
If Li Shiliu fails in the assassination
or if the situation changes,

04:56.430 --> 04:58.870
make sure to deploy more men near
the leisure boat.

04:58.870 --> 04:59.680
Yes.

05:00.070 --> 05:02.600
Great! Great!

05:21.950 --> 05:22.750
It's me.

05:23.390 --> 05:24.190
Come out.

05:37.360 --> 05:39.360
Yimeng has taken him to the riverside.

05:39.360 --> 05:41.490
When do you plan to make your move, sir?

05:42.380 --> 05:44.310
After one incense stick burns out.

05:47.740 --> 05:49.040
Mr. Li, aren't you going to ask me about

05:49.040 --> 05:50.840
the Qianyu Army's support plan?

05:59.240 --> 06:00.500
Such overconfidence.

06:00.730 --> 06:02.730
Be careful of losing your life here.

06:03.550 --> 06:04.810
His kung fu is not weak.

06:05.050 --> 06:06.130
If you fail,

06:06.240 --> 06:08.170
I urge you to not implicate Yimeng.

06:17.950 --> 06:19.210
Take care, Brother Li.

06:22.370 --> 06:24.100
You take care too, Brother Chu.

06:36.510 --> 06:37.440
Chu Guihong.

06:37.630 --> 06:38.800
Why did you hurt me?

06:39.270 --> 06:40.470
Who are you?

06:40.830 --> 06:42.530
I've known Li Shiliu for so long,

06:42.530 --> 06:44.460
he has never called me Brother Chu.

06:45.040 --> 06:46.700
Didn't you just call me Brother Li?

06:46.700 --> 06:48.500
Why can't I call you Brother Chu?

06:49.960 --> 06:52.040
I've crossed swords with Li Shiliu before.

06:52.040 --> 06:53.409
His kung fu is not weak.

06:53.440 --> 06:54.760
If someone were to ambush him,

06:54.760 --> 06:56.890
it wouldn't have succeeded so easily.

06:58.070 --> 06:58.870
Speak.

06:59.430 --> 07:00.830
Who are you really?

07:07.680 --> 07:10.180
Well done!

07:10.200 --> 07:12.750
Good!

07:12.750 --> 07:13.730
One more.

07:13.760 --> 07:14.390
Thank you.

07:14.390 --> 07:16.400
Here, this is yours. Hold it well.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.120
Next.

07:19.430 --> 07:20.360
Very nice.

07:20.510 --> 07:21.270
That's right.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.220
Indeed.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.300
Lanterns for sale!

07:25.750 --> 07:27.790
Lanterns, lanterns!

07:31.240 --> 07:32.370
Come and take a look!

07:39.770 --> 07:41.150
What wish did you make?

07:44.750 --> 07:46.510
Why don't you tell first, Your Highness.

07:46.510 --> 07:47.770
What wish did you make?

07:50.000 --> 07:52.000
I've never believed in these things.

07:52.000 --> 07:53.159
Whatever I want,

07:53.870 --> 07:55.180
I just earn it myself.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.890
However,

08:03.600 --> 08:05.130
as long as you serve me well,

08:05.870 --> 08:06.830
I will make

08:07.000 --> 08:08.530
all your wishes l come true.

08:10.510 --> 08:11.310
Really?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.040
Alright then.

08:14.120 --> 08:15.780
You better listen carefully.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.910
I want

08:18.120 --> 08:19.310
a dog that looks like a cat,

08:19.310 --> 08:20.600
a cat that looks like a dog,

08:20.600 --> 08:22.190
and a flying Pegasus.

08:22.190 --> 08:23.480
I also want a big house,

08:23.480 --> 08:25.390
to admire cedar in summer and lotus
flowers in winter.

08:25.390 --> 08:26.630
I want to not having to work all year
round.

08:26.630 --> 08:28.630
No presentations, no mental control,

08:28.630 --> 08:29.920
no encounters with overconfident
mediocre men.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.270
and no keyboard warriors when I'm online.

08:31.270 --> 08:32.150
As for the person I like,

08:32.150 --> 08:33.270
he should be a gentle puppy during the day

08:33.270 --> 08:34.320
and a fierce wolf at night.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.789
When he's free, he should also help me
walk

08:35.789 --> 08:37.390
the dog that looks like a cat.

08:42.600 --> 08:44.360
What nonsense are you talking about?

08:44.360 --> 08:45.150
See?

08:45.720 --> 08:47.050
You can't do it, can you?

08:47.910 --> 08:48.790
If you can't,

08:48.790 --> 08:50.670
cut it out with that bossy CEO act.

08:55.750 --> 08:56.550
I'll do it.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.150
I said I'll do it.

09:05.550 --> 09:08.080
As long as you help me find the method
of weapon forging,

09:08.080 --> 09:09.150
your wishes,

09:09.630 --> 09:11.090
I will fulfil them for you.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.510
You...

09:14.450 --> 09:15.810
What are you up to now?

09:22.050 --> 09:23.510
If I tell you

09:24.260 --> 09:25.920
that I can make them come true.

09:29.510 --> 09:30.970
I'm only asking this once.

09:34.840 --> 09:36.030
Will you trust me?

10:01.320 --> 10:02.120
I...

10:06.920 --> 10:08.320
I don't trust you one bit.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.510
Look, look, look!

10:31.510 --> 10:32.150
They're setting off fireworks!

10:32.150 --> 10:34.320
It's so beautiful!

10:38.320 --> 10:40.480
It's the fireworks prepared by the
Qianyu Army.

10:40.480 --> 10:41.200
Your Highness,

10:41.200 --> 10:42.860
let's get on the boat to watch.

11:08.970 --> 11:10.200
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.320
I'm clumsy.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.820
Please punish me, Miss.

11:13.410 --> 11:14.590
It's alright.

11:15.550 --> 11:17.200
Seventh Prince, I'm sorry.

11:17.200 --> 11:19.000
I'll go clean up over there first.

11:19.000 --> 11:19.630
You...

11:19.650 --> 11:20.550
Go ahead and eat and drink.

11:20.550 --> 11:21.750
Please wait a moment.

11:33.420 --> 11:34.730
Miss Song,

11:34.910 --> 11:37.770
I thought this Seventh Prince would be so
hard to kill,

11:37.770 --> 11:39.300
but he seems ordinary to me.

11:40.340 --> 11:41.840
With those acting skills just now,

11:41.840 --> 11:43.260
you still have the nerve to comment on
others?

11:43.260 --> 11:44.550
Let's quickly leave this place.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.350
Let's not delay Mr. Li's action.

12:03.910 --> 12:06.300
Thought it would be a final boss fight,

12:06.320 --> 12:09.350
turns out it's an immediate defeat.

12:13.720 --> 12:14.510
Chu Guihong,

12:15.480 --> 12:17.010
what is the meaning of this?

12:18.670 --> 12:20.640
There are thieves causing trouble in the
city tonight.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.040
I chased them to this place.

12:22.040 --> 12:24.370
I didn't expect to disturb Your Highness.

12:26.270 --> 12:28.730
Then it's your incompetence, Chu Guihong.

12:28.980 --> 12:30.410
Alllowing the criminals

12:30.720 --> 12:32.060
to escape to this place.

12:32.940 --> 12:34.380
You may excuse now.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.490
I will personally interrogate this person.

12:36.490 --> 12:37.220
No way.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.450
What does it have to do with you?

12:42.010 --> 12:43.080
Seventh Prince,

12:43.300 --> 12:44.890
maintaining the security of the capital

12:44.890 --> 12:47.150
is the duty of all citizens of Great Jing.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.650
In my opinion,

12:49.670 --> 12:51.060
this person is already injured.

12:51.060 --> 12:52.390
He seems quite pitiful.

12:52.400 --> 12:54.000
And he hasn't really done anything bad.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.450
Let's just release him.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.590
That's not possible.

12:56.590 --> 12:57.950
General Chu is right.

12:57.970 --> 12:59.590
Before we confirm this person's identity,

12:59.590 --> 13:00.790
we can't let them go easily.

13:00.790 --> 13:02.430
The Seventh Prince is right.

13:02.460 --> 13:04.270
Let the capital prefecture's office
interrogate them.

13:04.270 --> 13:05.080
No way.

13:05.290 --> 13:06.330
Miss Song,

13:06.480 --> 13:08.750
Chu doesn't look like a good person at
all.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.670
He's definitely putting on this act

13:09.670 --> 13:11.000
to harm Chief Master.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.950
What does this have to do with you?

13:13.080 --> 13:14.790
Miss Song said

13:14.790 --> 13:16.840
this is the duty of every citizen of
Great Jing.

13:16.840 --> 13:18.710
Today is the Lantern Festival.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.510
I suppose General Chu

13:20.750 --> 13:22.750
must have many matters to attend to.

13:23.510 --> 13:25.150
Why bother holding onto him?

13:28.200 --> 13:29.150
Stay back, all of you.

13:29.150 --> 13:31.200
Run! Someone's trying to assassinate in
public!

13:31.200 --> 13:32.160
Nan Heng,

13:32.550 --> 13:34.750
today I have come specifically to take
your life.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.030
Cover me while I jump off the boat.

13:36.030 --> 13:36.670
Let's go.

13:36.910 --> 13:37.720
Wait.

13:39.580 --> 13:44.610
[Peace & Prosperity]

13:44.670 --> 13:45.630
Our people.

13:46.310 --> 13:47.110
Our enemy.

13:47.720 --> 13:48.510
That's right.

13:48.510 --> 13:49.600
Why are you still acting?

13:49.600 --> 13:50.360
Get him!

13:51.270 --> 13:52.240
I... You...

13:53.510 --> 13:54.770
Don't come any closer.

13:56.080 --> 13:57.200
Seventh Prince!

13:57.550 --> 13:58.810
Don't- don't hurt him.

13:59.080 --> 13:59.940
Don't hurt him.

14:08.880 --> 14:10.500
The Seventh Prince has been attacked.

14:10.500 --> 14:12.060
The Xuanjia Army is here to investigate.

14:12.060 --> 14:13.320
Everyone, make way!

14:13.410 --> 14:14.630
Qianyu Army, listen up!

14:14.630 --> 14:16.290
Quickly follow me to the dock.

14:19.840 --> 14:21.690
-Get out of the way!
-Move!

14:22.270 --> 14:23.190
Make way!

14:23.210 --> 14:25.440
Make way, make way!

14:27.750 --> 14:28.550
Make way!

14:33.780 --> 14:34.590
Make way!

14:36.430 --> 14:37.040
Make way!

14:39.480 --> 14:40.150
Everyone stop right there!

14:40.150 --> 14:41.270
Your Highness, Your Highness.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.870
Don't be rash, don't be rash.

14:42.910 --> 14:44.640
Don't be rash, Seventh Prince.

14:45.890 --> 14:46.770
Chu Guihong,

14:47.440 --> 14:49.380
I need you to give me an explanation.

14:49.380 --> 14:51.790
What's your relationship with these
people?

14:51.790 --> 14:52.600
Also,

14:53.500 --> 14:54.790
in this assassination,

14:54.790 --> 14:56.320
how much were you involved?

14:57.440 --> 14:58.490
Seventh Prince,

14:59.120 --> 15:00.750
this has nothing to do with him.

15:00.750 --> 15:01.600
It was me.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.080
I did it all by myself.

15:03.120 --> 15:03.510
Song Yimeng.

15:03.510 --> 15:04.240
Yimeng.

15:04.240 --> 15:06.380
Do you know the gravity of the crime of
attempting to assassinate a prince?

15:06.380 --> 15:10.110
Your whole family will be executed.
Can you bear the consequences?

15:17.550 --> 15:18.880
I have to even if I can't.

15:19.000 --> 15:19.860
Your Highness.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.840
It's because I couldn't find what you
wanted.

15:21.840 --> 15:23.020
That's why I resorted to this desperate
measure.

15:23.020 --> 15:24.000
They are all innocent.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.400
Enough. I didn't ask you.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.360
Chu Guihong.

15:28.120 --> 15:29.720
You're the capital prefect.

15:30.080 --> 15:32.810
So tell me, which one of them
is telling the truth?

15:32.850 --> 15:33.680
Or maybe…

15:35.360 --> 15:37.090
the one who really wants me dead

15:37.780 --> 15:39.100
is you.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.550
As I said from the start,

15:42.570 --> 15:44.700
I was chasing a fugitive who fled here.

15:45.990 --> 15:48.050
As for these three people here,

15:49.030 --> 15:50.760
neither Yimeng nor I know them.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.790
Fine.

15:59.450 --> 16:00.590
Then I'll

16:01.480 --> 16:02.790
execute this criminal

16:03.580 --> 16:04.990
right here, right now.

16:05.960 --> 16:06.750
Nan Heng!

16:06.880 --> 16:07.980
Don't you hurt him!

16:08.010 --> 16:10.070
If you hurt him, I'll never let you go!

16:12.340 --> 16:13.140
Yimeng.

16:14.770 --> 16:16.340
Yimeng is a woman after all.

16:16.360 --> 16:18.190
She said that out of pity.

16:18.360 --> 16:19.220
Your Highness.

16:19.720 --> 16:20.630
Go ahead.

16:22.660 --> 16:23.630
Chu Guihong,

16:23.700 --> 16:25.310
what the hell are you saying?

16:25.750 --> 16:27.080
Yimeng, go back first.

16:27.080 --> 16:28.320
I'll explain everything later.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.080
You…

16:29.100 --> 16:29.960
Your Highness!

16:29.960 --> 16:30.670
General!

16:31.570 --> 16:34.300
[Peace & Prosperity]

16:34.670 --> 16:35.510
Apologies for the delay.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.200
General.

16:36.220 --> 16:37.360
-Take him back!
-Take him back!

16:37.360 --> 16:38.080
-Yes!
-Yes!

16:44.550 --> 16:45.720
They're ours!

16:46.960 --> 16:47.970
Yimeng!

16:57.510 --> 16:59.480
Your Highness, are you alright?

16:59.030 --> 17:01.610
♪ A lifetime can't be penned,
old wounds still remain ♪

17:02.520 --> 17:04.950
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

17:05.900 --> 17:09.050
♪ Once I spoken the promise,
what fear is death to me? ♪

17:10.119 --> 17:11.660
♪ Even dreams taste free ♪

17:12.650 --> 17:15.849
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

17:16.829 --> 17:20.839
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

17:21.770 --> 17:25.170
♪ I gave you a love etched deep in bone ♪

17:26.250 --> 17:28.930
♪ That's already sufficient ♪

17:35.110 --> 17:37.160
Move aside! Move aside!

17:37.310 --> 17:38.110
Chu Guihong.

17:41.470 --> 17:43.000
About tonight's incident,

17:43.360 --> 17:46.360
I'm waiting for a satisfactory explanation
from you.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.550
Great!

18:02.700 --> 18:04.790
Mr. Li should be far away by now.

18:14.130 --> 18:14.930
Oh no.

18:15.890 --> 18:17.720
Mr. Li failed his assassination attempt.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.140
Nan Heng didn't die.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.310
That means...

18:21.630 --> 18:23.960
Everything will still unfold as written.

18:24.530 --> 18:25.520
It's over.

18:38.320 --> 18:39.350
The light stand!

18:43.070 --> 18:44.160
Go check over there.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.720
Don't let any suspicious person go.

18:45.720 --> 18:46.400
Yes.

18:51.550 --> 18:52.350
Yimeng.

18:54.310 --> 18:55.110
Yimeng.

18:56.080 --> 18:58.110
Yimeng, that person wasn't Li Shiliu.

18:58.110 --> 18:59.370
What happened tonight feels off too.

18:59.370 --> 19:00.270
Trust me.

19:01.770 --> 19:02.680
Chu Guihong.

19:02.750 --> 19:04.530
You've been suspicious of him from the
beginning.

19:04.530 --> 19:06.750
Now it's come to this, are you satisfied?

19:06.750 --> 19:07.310
I...

19:07.310 --> 19:08.370
Listen to me first.

19:08.440 --> 19:10.770
Tonight's events are just the beginning.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.510
Later in this market,

19:12.530 --> 19:13.910
there will be a fire.

19:14.160 --> 19:16.230
Many innocent people will be hurt.

19:16.270 --> 19:17.520
If you believe me,

19:17.880 --> 19:19.310
can you send the Qianyu Army

19:19.310 --> 19:21.920
to follow me and prevent all this from
happening?

19:21.920 --> 19:22.720
A fire?

19:25.480 --> 19:28.010
Why would a fire suddenly break out in
the city?

19:28.010 --> 19:29.020
-Yimeng.
-I…

19:29.180 --> 19:30.160
Right now, Rong Hua and the others

19:30.160 --> 19:32.050
are searching everywhere for Li Shiliu.

19:32.050 --> 19:34.830
and Nan Heng's people are still watching
closely.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.000
I can't leave here.

19:40.030 --> 19:41.140
I knew it.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.000
Yimeng.

19:42.520 --> 19:44.320
Let me send you home first, okay?

19:44.420 --> 19:45.750
So much has happened tonight.

19:45.750 --> 19:47.570
Nan Heng surely won't let this go.

19:47.570 --> 19:49.700
I'll only be at ease if you stay at home.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.550
No need.

19:50.780 --> 19:52.510
Yimeng, where are you going?

19:54.350 --> 19:55.400
To find Mr. Li.

19:56.030 --> 19:57.090
Together with him,

19:57.920 --> 19:59.250
we'll change the world.

20:42.510 --> 20:44.400
Although tonight's plan went awry,

20:44.400 --> 20:45.750
at least the intended goals

20:45.750 --> 20:46.880
have been achieved.

20:49.650 --> 20:50.790
Everything's settled now.

20:50.790 --> 20:52.790
Why did you change into this outfit?

20:53.350 --> 20:54.550
Don't worry about it.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.930
Aren't you injured? Go back first.

20:57.920 --> 21:00.980
Are you worried about the chaos
Song Yimeng mentioned?

21:02.590 --> 21:04.430
Put your mind at ease.

21:04.960 --> 21:06.350
The Qianyu Army is now going all out

21:06.350 --> 21:07.720
to search for Li Shiliu.

21:07.960 --> 21:10.830
The entire capital is sealed tight like
an iron bucket.

21:10.830 --> 21:11.880
Only you would dare

21:11.880 --> 21:14.160
to cause trouble on a night like this.

21:16.990 --> 21:18.540
This is the key point.

21:21.110 --> 21:22.960
I've been thinking these past few days

21:22.960 --> 21:24.880
about the chaos Song Yimeng mentioned.

21:24.880 --> 21:27.340
What exactly is it? What's the purpose?

21:27.740 --> 21:29.090
And who's behind it all?

21:31.180 --> 21:34.350
If things go wrong at the Lantern Festival
and Chu Guihong takes the blame,

21:34.350 --> 21:36.620
I should be the one who benefits the most.

21:36.780 --> 21:39.310
I'm sure Your Majesty can figure that out
too.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.140
But behind the scenes,

21:42.210 --> 21:44.170
who would be the one

21:45.680 --> 21:47.010
who reaps the benefits?

22:10.720 --> 22:14.200
Wait for me! Wait for me!

22:16.500 --> 22:20.390
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 10, Scene 21]

22:23.350 --> 22:24.610
It's here.

22:24.850 --> 22:26.070
It's this archway.

22:37.000 --> 22:37.720
Please make way!

22:37.720 --> 22:39.350
Sir, this fire is very dangerous.

22:39.350 --> 22:40.510
Put it out quickly!

22:43.830 --> 22:44.920
Stop, stop, stop!

22:45.200 --> 22:46.000
Danger!

22:47.440 --> 22:49.140
Miss, this fire is too dangerous!

22:49.140 --> 22:49.590
It's too dangerous!

22:49.590 --> 22:50.650
What are you doing?

22:51.200 --> 22:52.400
Demotion.

22:53.610 --> 22:57.850
Not demoting others, only me.

23:05.000 --> 23:07.640
Failing to live up to lofty ambitions,

23:07.960 --> 23:10.040
with impressive talents.

23:11.030 --> 23:14.280
A lifetime's aspirations never fulfilled.

23:14.640 --> 23:16.430
Never fulfilled!

23:20.070 --> 23:21.600
Watch out!

23:33.260 --> 23:35.870
Fire! Fire! Fire!

23:35.900 --> 23:37.660
Help! There's a fire!

23:37.690 --> 23:38.620
Run!

23:38.850 --> 23:39.850
Run!

23:40.270 --> 23:43.680
Run! Run!

23:56.950 --> 23:57.900
Little one!

23:57.960 --> 23:59.220
Little one, get up quickly!

23:59.220 --> 24:00.910
Quick, be careful!

24:01.270 --> 24:02.060
Thank you!

24:06.300 --> 24:07.400
Be careful!

24:34.880 --> 24:38.650
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

24:39.510 --> 24:42.440
♪ A heart of pure,
roaming free across the lands ♪

24:43.630 --> 24:46.440
♪ No waiting, no hate,
I write my own story ♪

24:47.480 --> 24:49.980
♪ I give my all for what I believe in ♪

24:50.860 --> 24:54.730
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

24:55.490 --> 24:58.370
♪ And run into the fog with no regrets ♪

24:59.470 --> 25:02.450
♪ Even if rain pours on the path ahead ♪

25:03.200 --> 25:04.030
Are you okay?

25:03.550 --> 25:06.020
♪ For this life, for all beings ♪

25:04.750 --> 25:06.400
I'm fine

25:06.480 --> 25:08.970
♪ Sweeping through a thousand years
of dust ♪

25:08.620 --> 25:11.100
Mr. Li, are you alright?

25:13.610 --> 25:15.740
Just a minor injury, nothing serious.

25:21.310 --> 25:22.070
Move aside! Move aside! Move aside!

25:22.070 --> 25:23.310
Make way! We're here to put out the fire!

25:23.310 --> 25:24.860
Move aside! Make way!

25:25.750 --> 25:27.060
Hurry up! Move aside!

25:27.110 --> 25:28.030
Quickly! Clear the way!

25:28.030 --> 25:29.890
-Put out the fire, quick!
-Hurry!

25:32.720 --> 25:33.830
-Hurry!
-Let’s go.

25:33.880 --> 25:34.830
-Follow me. This way.
-Hurry!

25:34.830 --> 25:36.830
Get those civilians out of there! Hurry!

25:36.830 --> 25:38.360
Here, water! We need water!

25:38.440 --> 25:40.000
Quick! Over there, over there!

25:40.000 --> 25:41.270
Slow down a bit! Move slowly!

25:41.270 --> 25:42.040
Go!

25:56.350 --> 25:59.350
The chaotic Lantern Festival and the fire
in the city.

25:59.720 --> 26:01.750
Everything you said has come true.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.440
How did you know?

26:07.680 --> 26:08.640
Mr. Li.

26:10.310 --> 26:11.590
Do you believe in fate?

26:14.550 --> 26:15.480
What do you mean?

26:20.240 --> 26:21.510
In this world,

26:22.180 --> 26:23.660
everyone's birth

26:24.570 --> 26:26.440
was prewritten in a script,

26:27.980 --> 26:30.510
with all the joys and sorrows
predetermined.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.510
And in the end,

26:32.720 --> 26:33.880
it leads to

26:34.870 --> 26:37.080
an outcome you can never change.

26:38.510 --> 26:40.270
This is the rule of this world.

26:43.000 --> 26:44.420
I don't believe in those

26:44.510 --> 26:45.770
heretical teachings.

26:47.360 --> 26:49.360
Mountains weren't born with peaks,

26:49.400 --> 26:51.070
and roads weren't born flat.

26:52.270 --> 26:54.160
Whether it's humiliation or ups and downs,

26:54.160 --> 26:55.440
joy or sorrow,

26:56.120 --> 26:57.650
I have my own hands and feet.

26:58.310 --> 27:01.510
I can trample through thorns and
aim my blade up at the sky.

27:02.310 --> 27:03.350
Why should the outcome

27:03.350 --> 27:05.410
of my life be in someone else's hands?

27:06.300 --> 27:07.480
If there is really some rule‑maker

27:07.480 --> 27:09.480
pulling strings behind the scenes,

27:10.050 --> 27:12.390
then I should be the one holding the pen.

27:22.840 --> 27:23.980
I knew it.

27:24.860 --> 27:28.150
The Lantern Festival was meant to be a
disaster,

27:29.000 --> 27:30.470
and between us two,

27:30.500 --> 27:32.230
there was no fate for us to meet.

27:32.700 --> 27:34.400
But ever since you, Mr. Li,

27:34.430 --> 27:36.850
saved me at Waning River Crescent,

27:37.310 --> 27:39.110
I've always felt that something

27:39.600 --> 27:40.800
has been changed.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.000
Mr. Li,

27:46.040 --> 27:46.950
thank you.

27:54.200 --> 27:55.070
I knew it.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.720
Fate

27:56.960 --> 27:58.570
could be changed.

27:58.890 --> 27:59.930
The world

28:00.130 --> 28:02.360
can also be changed.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.820
Search every corner thoroughly.

28:38.830 --> 28:39.960
Yes.

28:42.240 --> 28:43.030
General,

28:43.940 --> 28:45.960
everything here has been taken care of.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.830
All potential risks have been identified
and addressed.

28:47.830 --> 28:49.830
There shouldn't be any more issues.

28:49.920 --> 28:50.720
Good.

28:51.510 --> 28:52.710
What about Li Shiliu?

28:54.350 --> 28:56.170
One of our men just reported

28:56.200 --> 28:58.810
that they spotted him near Weishui Street.

28:59.270 --> 29:01.580
I've sent two men to follow him.

29:01.750 --> 29:02.810
Let's go there too.

29:02.850 --> 29:04.370
General. General.

29:04.920 --> 29:05.720
What is it?

29:06.480 --> 29:09.090
Didn't you mention that you wanted to

29:09.160 --> 29:12.250
set off fireworks for Miss Song during
the Lantern Festival?

29:12.250 --> 29:13.910
Besides what we used today,

29:14.240 --> 29:15.710
I've specially kept some aside.

29:15.710 --> 29:17.490
Would you like to give Miss Song

29:17.770 --> 29:19.020
a surprise?

29:21.970 --> 29:22.910
Not now.

29:24.380 --> 29:25.710
Let's go find Li Shiliu.

29:33.710 --> 29:35.720
Mr. Li, let me help you apply it.

29:35.720 --> 29:36.920
Come on, give it to me.

29:39.070 --> 29:39.920
I know.

29:40.480 --> 29:42.440
Burns are the most painful.

29:43.240 --> 29:44.510
I'm not sure if this medicine

29:44.510 --> 29:46.040
contains any antibiotics.

29:52.270 --> 29:54.600
The medical conditions here must be poor.

29:54.820 --> 29:56.520
Remember when you go back,

29:56.540 --> 29:57.860
keep the wound dry.

29:57.990 --> 30:00.310
And you can't eat any inflammatory foods.

30:00.310 --> 30:02.270
Things like lamb, beef,

30:02.270 --> 30:03.130
seafood and such.

30:03.130 --> 30:04.240
None of these are allowed.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.590
If you're not careful,

30:05.590 --> 30:07.640
this arm of yours could be ruined.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.620
How can a swordsman who can't hold
a sword,

30:11.620 --> 30:13.220
still be called a swordsman?

30:16.360 --> 30:19.020
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

30:19.840 --> 30:22.340
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

30:23.370 --> 30:26.710
♪ That is the meaning behind my defiance ♪

30:30.370 --> 30:32.970
♪ Even doomed for eternity, I still have
the courage ♪

30:33.350 --> 30:34.510
How can you say it's nothing?

30:33.650 --> 30:36.280
♪ For you, I’d step into the uncertainty ♪

30:34.510 --> 30:35.400
You've lost so much blood.

30:35.400 --> 30:35.920
No, no, no.

30:35.920 --> 30:37.270
You definitely got hurt
when you tried to save us.

30:37.260 --> 30:40.630
♪ If you truly believe in this destiny ♪

30:37.270 --> 30:37.920
No, no, no.

30:37.920 --> 30:40.120
I've prepared some small gifts for you.

30:40.640 --> 30:41.840
Thank you, Miss Song.

30:42.070 --> 30:44.400
But Mr. Li saved my life.

30:42.690 --> 30:45.240
♪ Is it self-inflicted or willful
obsession? ♪

30:44.920 --> 30:46.310
At a time like this,

30:46.090 --> 30:50.200
♪ Is it overestimating myself,
yet still without regret? ♪

30:46.310 --> 30:48.170
how can you still not trust Mr. Li?

30:48.720 --> 30:50.840
Nan Heng, don't touch him!

30:50.860 --> 30:52.470
If you hurt him, I'll never let you go!

30:51.140 --> 30:54.510
♪ To give you a love etched into the
bones ♪

30:53.480 --> 30:54.270
Let's go

30:55.420 --> 30:56.480
♪ Then it's not something to grieve ♪

30:57.840 --> 31:02.340
♪ If tears are proof that I once loved ♪

31:04.450 --> 31:09.970
♪ If loss is the trace of having existed ♪

31:12.290 --> 31:13.770
♪ Then let the tears fall ♪

31:14.730 --> 31:16.420
♪ Let me love you ♪

31:17.240 --> 31:22.870
♪ And fade away with one last dream ♪

31:27.310 --> 31:28.350
Did I hurt you?

31:29.650 --> 31:30.580
No, not at all.

31:33.110 --> 31:33.970
Do you...

31:34.030 --> 31:35.620
do this often?

31:35.750 --> 31:36.830
Of course not.

31:37.550 --> 31:39.020
I'm not a doctor.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.750
That's not what I meant.

31:42.760 --> 31:43.730
Then what?

31:54.800 --> 31:56.230
Mr. Li,

31:57.160 --> 31:59.200
you're not feeling awkward, are you?

31:59.200 --> 32:00.480
Because I touched you?

32:02.400 --> 32:03.850
No, how could that be?

32:04.000 --> 32:05.110
I've been roaming the world for years.

32:05.110 --> 32:06.640
What have I not seen before?

32:06.640 --> 32:08.160
This is nothing.

32:08.180 --> 32:08.820
Yes, yes, yes.

32:08.820 --> 32:09.620
You're right.

32:10.000 --> 32:12.030
Everything must seem trivial

32:12.160 --> 32:14.030
to a great hero like you, right?

32:20.750 --> 32:21.750
Then, Mr. Li,

32:22.400 --> 32:25.610
being defeated and held captive by
Nan Heng today,

32:25.790 --> 32:27.070
to you,

32:27.480 --> 32:28.940
is that also not a big deal?

32:33.400 --> 32:35.600
Why are you speaking so sarcastically?

32:36.400 --> 32:37.460
Let me ask you this.

32:38.000 --> 32:39.220
Nan Heng already knows

32:39.220 --> 32:41.830
you're involved in today's assassination
attempt.

32:41.830 --> 32:43.760
How are you going to get out of this?

32:47.640 --> 32:48.370
I don't know.

32:53.260 --> 32:54.210
Whatever.

32:54.350 --> 32:55.480
Fighting or killing,

32:55.480 --> 32:56.960
that's all for tomorrow.

32:58.040 --> 33:00.330
Tonight, let's just sit here

33:00.680 --> 33:02.480
and enjoy the Lantern Festival.

33:07.260 --> 33:09.350
Acting without thinking things through.

33:09.350 --> 33:10.460
How can there be

33:10.790 --> 33:12.520
someone like you in this world?

33:12.750 --> 33:14.180
Why not?

33:15.510 --> 33:18.000
It's because in this world,

33:18.160 --> 33:20.380
there are always things

33:20.440 --> 33:22.970
beyond your consideration and calculation.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.620
If you have ever experienced

33:25.790 --> 33:28.440
trying your hardest to reach the top,

33:29.110 --> 33:30.970
but never being able to get there,

33:31.440 --> 33:33.160
then you should understand

33:33.840 --> 33:37.170
that enjoying the view from the bottom
can be quite nice too.

33:41.590 --> 33:42.790
Don't think too much.

33:42.810 --> 33:45.810
These are things for the protagonists
to worry about.

33:47.370 --> 33:48.970
I've been wanting to ask you,

33:49.790 --> 33:51.050
what is a protagonist?

33:51.350 --> 33:53.880
And what is a male lead, which
you mentioned?

33:56.120 --> 33:57.950
A male lead...

33:59.830 --> 34:02.750
A male lead is usually

34:03.790 --> 34:05.350
the most capable character in a script.

34:05.350 --> 34:07.310
He must be handsome, capable, and tragic.

34:07.310 --> 34:10.219
He must possess all the virtues.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.350
He must

34:12.370 --> 34:13.920
take others' sacrifices

34:13.920 --> 34:15.400
for granted.

34:15.590 --> 34:17.320
He must be ruthless.

34:17.429 --> 34:18.219
He must-

34:22.190 --> 34:23.130
In short,

34:23.230 --> 34:24.489
he's not a good person.

34:31.070 --> 34:32.360
And you said that

34:32.469 --> 34:34.199
Nan Heng is the main character.

34:35.710 --> 34:36.710
But what about me?

34:36.840 --> 34:37.710
What am I?

34:40.070 --> 34:40.880
You...

34:41.730 --> 34:43.800
You're naturally a supporting character.

34:43.800 --> 34:46.429
Supporting characters in scripts

34:47.360 --> 34:48.590
are usually not very important

34:48.590 --> 34:50.250
and don't have much presence.

34:54.100 --> 34:55.760
If I'm not important,

34:56.360 --> 34:57.890
why did you save me just now?

34:59.660 --> 35:01.430
How can you say that, Mr. Li?

35:01.670 --> 35:03.750
A supporting character's life is still
a life.

35:03.750 --> 35:05.280
Besides, you've helped me before.

35:05.280 --> 35:07.440
So to me, you are very important.

35:09.240 --> 35:12.140
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

35:13.780 --> 35:15.740
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

35:14.420 --> 35:15.950
Such beautiful fireworks!

35:17.380 --> 35:20.300
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

35:21.310 --> 35:24.020
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

35:25.030 --> 35:27.900
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

35:29.490 --> 35:31.460
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

35:33.370 --> 35:36.090
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

35:37.150 --> 35:39.850
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

35:40.780 --> 35:42.980
The script never mentioned

35:42.490 --> 35:49.490
♪ Look at the vast heavens,
letting rain fall, indifferent to all ♪

35:43.000 --> 35:46.260
that the fireworks in this world would be
so beautiful.

35:47.530 --> 35:48.690
And

35:49.240 --> 35:50.670
it also didn't mention

35:50.560 --> 35:57.460
♪ Watch how time quietly
waits for stories to take root ♪

35:58.220 --> 36:05.090
♪ Look at the road ahead,
in the end, there will be guiding lights ♪

36:02.660 --> 36:04.790
that a faceless supporting character

36:04.880 --> 36:06.320
could be so cool.

36:06.310 --> 36:19.260
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

36:38.190 --> 36:39.400
It's nothing.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.870
Jixiang,

36:41.670 --> 36:43.290
did you see how many times

36:43.480 --> 36:46.420
Yiting smiled at me just now?

36:48.440 --> 36:50.570
It must have been at least three times.

36:51.590 --> 36:52.920
I knew it,

36:52.940 --> 36:56.200
she's not completely indifferent to me.

36:58.290 --> 37:01.870
In the capital, among all the officials,

37:02.070 --> 37:05.880
can you find even half a person
who can match me?

37:07.280 --> 37:08.340
Not half a person,

37:08.630 --> 37:09.760
but whole ones,

37:09.780 --> 37:10.570
quite a few.

37:12.590 --> 37:13.400
Shut up!

37:14.070 --> 37:15.460
Look at yourself,

37:15.830 --> 37:17.760
and then look at Fugui.

37:18.730 --> 37:21.360
I've been suppressed by Heng for
so many years,

37:21.360 --> 37:23.330
at least half the responsibility

37:24.860 --> 37:25.660
lies with you.

37:48.400 --> 37:49.610
Are you alright?

37:50.280 --> 37:51.070
I'm fine.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.440
I'm perfectly sober.

37:54.710 --> 37:55.510
Let's go.

37:57.510 --> 37:59.670
Shouldn't we be going backwards?

38:00.150 --> 38:01.350
Don't worry about it.

38:01.560 --> 38:03.650
I'll go wherever I want.

38:03.760 --> 38:05.300
Hurry up and finish moving everything.

38:04.100 --> 38:07.260
[Dry weather; No candles or open flames]

38:06.190 --> 38:08.000
Be careful, these wooden boxes are
full of fireworks.

38:08.000 --> 38:09.550
Highly flammable and explosive.
There's no room for error.

38:09.550 --> 38:10.190
Yes.

38:13.400 --> 38:14.530
Eighteenth Prince!

38:19.920 --> 38:21.260
Qianyu Army,

38:22.400 --> 38:23.730
what are you doing here?

38:23.800 --> 38:24.860
Where's my cousin?

38:24.880 --> 38:25.740
Your Highness,

38:25.760 --> 38:27.590
there were assassins and a fire tonight.

38:27.590 --> 38:29.590
The general has taken men to patrol.

38:30.150 --> 38:30.920
Assassins?

38:32.420 --> 38:34.280
Where did the assassins come from?

38:34.280 --> 38:36.150
If there are any assassins, I'll kick...

38:36.150 --> 38:37.680
Your Highness, be careful!

38:37.710 --> 38:38.960
These are all fireworks.

38:38.960 --> 38:39.760
Fireworks?

38:40.440 --> 38:41.420
Yes.

38:41.590 --> 38:42.400
What a pity.

38:42.420 --> 38:43.800
These took a lot of effort

38:43.800 --> 38:45.340
to bring back from abroad.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.510
Just a few days ago, the general said

38:46.510 --> 38:47.820
he wanted to set them off for Miss Song.

38:47.820 --> 38:50.480
But just now he said it's not necessary
anymore.

38:51.630 --> 38:53.690
Fireworks from abroad...

38:54.110 --> 38:56.550
Yiting must have never seen them before.

38:57.410 --> 38:59.200
If my cousin doesn't want them,

39:00.440 --> 39:02.500
I'll set them off for Yiting.

39:04.570 --> 39:05.900
Come on, give them to me.

39:28.760 --> 39:29.760
Run!

39:32.970 --> 39:35.610
Help! Help!

39:42.400 --> 39:43.070
Granny!

39:43.070 --> 39:44.470
Are you alright, Granny?

39:44.590 --> 39:45.840
Come on, get up quickly.

39:45.840 --> 39:47.550
The oil mill! The children!

39:47.550 --> 39:48.510
There are still children inside!

39:48.510 --> 39:50.240
Don't worry, I'll go save them.

39:51.370 --> 39:52.000
I'll go.

40:28.620 --> 40:30.020
Where are you running to?

40:31.760 --> 40:33.280
Get inside!

40:55.170 --> 40:56.510
It's okay, go quickly! Hurry!

40:56.510 --> 40:57.450
Alright, alright.
